## Optional OpenAI image analysis

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and add your own API key:

```powershell
Copy-Item .env.example .env
```

```dotenv
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
```

Select **Add optional OpenAI style description** in the app. The OpenAI API is billed separately from ChatGPT and requires an enabled API project with model access. Do **not** commit `.env`.

