## Data source and attribution

Dataset: [ashraq/fashion-product-images-small](https://huggingface.co/datasets/ashraq/fashion-product-images-small) (44,072 original items). Its images and item metadata come from the [Fashion Product Images Kaggle dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/paramaggarwal/fashion-product-images-small). This project downloads a subset at setup time and does not redistribute the images. Check the original dataset/image licensing and terms before commercial use or redistribution.

## Troubleshooting

- `No module named datasets`: install via the project environment's `python -m pip install -r requirements.txt`.
- Missing `data/products.csv` or `data/embeddings.npz`: run both scripts in order.
- Torch/torchvision mismatch: recreate the virtual environment and reinstall dependencies; ensure a supported Python version.
- OpenAI errors: search works without OpenAI; verify your key/model/billing if enabling AI descriptions.
- Port 5000 busy: edit `server_port` in `app.py`.

## Limitations / future improvements

- ResNet50 embeddings are generic visual features; a fashion-specific embedding model could improve retrieval.
- Matching whole images is not the same as segmenting individual garments.
- Add evaluation examples and ranked retrieval metrics when ground-truth labels are available.
- No item listings, real-time prices, purchasing links or inventory verification are provided.
